OL,3,AMan charged with causing death by
OL,4,Adangerous driving over crash that
OL,5,Akilled 6
OL,6,
OL,7,FChristopher Cockell, 50, is due to
OL,8,Fappear at Leeds Magistrates' Court in
OL,9,FOctober charged with six counts of
OL,10,Fcausing death by dangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
