OL,3,ACNN, MS NOW and Politico file lawsuit
OL,4,Aagainst Trump's White House ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FCNN, Politico and MS NOW have sued the
OL,7,FTrump administration after the three US
OL,8,Fmedia outlets were barred from the
OL,9,FWhite House.
OL,11,FPresident Donald Trump announced the
OL,12,Fban on Friday, accusing the
OL,13,Forganisations of writing "fiction or
OL,14,Flies" about his team. The companies
OL,15,Fsaid their reporters were denied access
OL,16,Fto the building on Saturday.
OL,18,FIn a joint statement on Monday, they
OL,19,Fsaid they were pursuing legal action to
OL,20,F"defend the principle that the
OL,21,Fgovernment does not decide what the
OL,22,Fpress reports".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
