OL,3,ACNN, MS NOW and Politico file lawsuit
OL,4,Aagainst Trump's White House ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor US TV networks later announced
OL,7,Fthey would suspend their White House
OL,8,Fpooled coverage of Trump, leaving a
OL,9,Fpotential gap as he heads to New York
OL,10,Ffor the United Nations General
OL,11,FAssembly.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
